> <Role / Usage / Source / NIAS>
Vulcanizing agent, accelerator for rubber; preservative for natural rubber latex; fungicide; insecticide; seed protectant/disinfectant; animal repellent; antioxidant for polyolefins; lube oil additive; in food-pkg. adhesives; accelerator for food-contact rubber articles for repeated use; antiseptic; antibacterial, antifungal for topical pharmaceuticals.
Widly used with natural and synthetic rubbers for the manufacture of automobile and bicycle tyres/tubes and other technical goods, conveyor/transmission belting, retreading material, footwear, hot air cured products and miscellaneous moulded and extruded rubber products.

